  "body": "The spec currently does not specify how Bluetooth device permissions should be stored. There is a [note](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#bluetooth) that mentions that an origin can access any service whose UUID was listed in the request device filters and optional services.\r\n\r\nThe WebUSB spec has a [explicit algorithm](https://wicg.github.io/webusb/#add-device-to-storage) for storing granted device permissions, so we should probably do the same for Web Bluetooth.",
